@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@token = {{authToken}}
@applicationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Login as school/admin user first in your environment and set {{authToken}}
# POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# {
#   "email": "admin@moazez.dev",
#   "password": "Admin123!"
# }

### Get Admissions applications list with documentsSummary/dashboardState
GET {{baseUrl}}/admissions/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Admissions application detail with documentsSummary/dashboardState
GET {{baseUrl}}/admissions/applications/{{applicationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get effective workflow policy
GET {{baseUrl}}/admissions/workflow-policy
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Patch workflow policy - optional tests/interviews, allow direct acceptance
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admissions/workflow-policy
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requiresPlacementTest": false,
  "requiresInterview": false,
  "allowDirectAcceptance": true
}

### Patch workflow policy - strict default-like override
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admissions/workflow-policy
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requiresPlacementTest": true,
  "requiresInterview": true,
  "allowDirectAcceptance": false
}

### Patch workflow policy - expected validation failure: empty body
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admissions/workflow-policy
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Re-read application detail after policy update
GET {{baseUrl}}/admissions/applications/{{applicationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
